[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7440.55, "timestamp": "02:04:00", "text": "比如，他们会为不同的场合聘请歌手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7443.589, "timestamp": "02:04:03", "text": "人物。这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7445.27, "timestamp": "02:04:05", "text": "呃，这就像会有……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7447.589, "timestamp": "02:04:07", "text": "角色，对吧？将会有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7450.07, "timestamp": "02:04:10", "text": "狱警。警卫在那里，向导在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7452.87, "timestamp": "02:04:12", "text": "在那里，他们全都是囚犯。他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7454.629, "timestamp": "02:04:14", "text": "呃，他们都有自己的故事，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7456.95, "timestamp": "02:04:16", "text": "一切。这些故事将被展示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7459.109, "timestamp": "02:04:19", "text": "以音乐视频的形式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7464.31, "timestamp": "02:04:24", "text": "一切。例如，嗯，她的阿曼有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7468.87, "timestamp": "02:04:28", "text": "她的东西。我觉得是第一集。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7471.75, "timestamp": "02:04:31", "text": "等等，它在哪儿？我该如何找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7474.47, "timestamp": "02:04:34", "text": "阿曼的音乐作品？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7476.47, "timestamp": "02:04:36", "text": "我忘了。我觉得它在YouTube上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7478.95, "timestamp": "02:04:38", "text": "通道毫克。是的。是的。每一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7481.109, "timestamp": "02:04:41", "text": "角色都有自己独特的故事线"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7485.91, "timestamp": "02:04:45", "text": "就像她的故事，她的故事。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7488.709, "timestamp": "02:04:48", "text": "太多事情了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7490.79, "timestamp": "02:04:50", "text": "所以我想做类似的事情。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7493.51, "timestamp": "02:04:53", "text": "我意识到了太多事情。我要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7496.07, "timestamp": "02:04:56", "text": "给某人打个电话，等一会儿。你好。小心。拿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7498.149, "timestamp": "02:04:58", "text": "关心。"}]